Note on the corpus: every value in it is fictitious and was generated from a
national format rule under a fixed seed, then validated against the governing
standard. No value was sampled from any real or public source. The corpus is
published so that the measurements in the paper can be reproduced; it must not
be used to construct or enrich any profile of a real person.

